\section{Results}
\label{sec:results}

We organize results around seven findings (F1--F7) that trace a predictive pathway from trained temporal conditioning to pathological value dynamics. All experiments use Walker Walk (DMC) with DreamerV3; treatments run to 105K steps and the baseline to 505K steps. We report evaluation returns (mean over 10 episodes) and the normalized value-to-eval ratio ($\nve$, \S\ref{sec:metrics}).

%% ============================================================
%% TABLE 1: Main results summary
%% ============================================================

\begin{table*}[t]
\centering
\caption{Key configurations and outcomes. NVE reports peak $\nve$ in the 35K+ window (\S\ref{sec:metrics}). CIVO-positive seeds are shaded. Complete results for all 43 configurations in Table~\ref{tab:complete_results}.}
\label{tab:main_results}
\footnotesize
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{4pt}
\begin{tabular}{llcccccl}
\toprule
\textbf{Exp} & \textbf{Config} & \textbf{dt\_emb} & \textbf{Sub} & \textbf{H} & \textbf{Eval@final} & \textbf{NVE} & \textbf{Outcome} \\
\midrule
001 & Baseline ($\dt{=}1$) & --- & --- & 15 & 915.7 @105K & 1.00$\times$ & Healthy \\
\midrule
\rowcolor{gray!15}
008d & Factorial (s1) & trn & ON & 8 & 82.8 @55K & 4.12$\times$ & Full collapse \\
008f & No dt\_emb (s1) & --- & ON & 8 & 503.0 @105K & 0.97$\times$ & Healthy \\
008a & Unexposed emb & exp$^a$ & OFF & 15 & 777.7 @105K & 0.93$\times$ & Healthy \\
015b & Frozen emb & frz$^b$ & ON & 8 & 204.2 @105K & 1.45$\times$ & Grad.\ starvation \\
022b & Frozen emb + Gumbel gate & frz$^b$ & ON & 8 & 300.7 @105K & 0.63$\times$ & No CIVO \\
\midrule
\multicolumn{8}{l}{\textit{Cross-environment validation}} \\
\rowcolor{gray!15}
010b & Cheetah Run & trn & ON & 8 & 51.7 @105K & 8.27$\times$ & Collapsed \\
019b & PickCube-v1 & trn & ON & 8 & 26.64 @200K & 3.78$\times$$^c$ & Transient onset \\
049 & StackCube-v1 & trn & ON & 8 & 34.9 @212K & 5.05$\times$$^d$ & Env.\ transient \\
050 & PegInsertionSide-v1 & trn & ON & 8 & 20.86 @212K & 10.05$\times$$^e$ & Env.\ dynamics$^e$ \\
